{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "Backstory", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/acf55a1c074a12817f2a1aab9e0f188852897f0720ba8a296b08cc119bbd9ae3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5]]}, {"text": "Last month, I was interested in attending a camping event with my girlfriend.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/5921198e78b8a1323d7c2054c46497675e441b1ed3de8cfe33b5d032c393168f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.56], [2, 0.78, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.38], [9, 2.38, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.06], [12, 3.06, 3.34]]}, {"text": "The event organizers release the tickets in two phases with each phase releasing 1000 tickets.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/48d9cde60b56d0828c69852bfbb20fb1363b12a09f2da5edd8f3704186f2ea34.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 2.0], [7, 2.0, 2.24], [8, 2.24, 2.64], [9, 3.06, 3.2], [10, 3.2, 3.5], [11, 3.5, 3.72], [12, 3.72, 4.02], [14, 4.72, 5.02]]}, {"text": "Despite my wicked fast internet connection at Panera Bread, I was unable to purchase the released tickets before they sold out.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/1bb9b4632bf4ff4a586b886c05f4b64547a1f8b3b5553c6b895e24a4715a0482.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 2.0], [6, 2.0, 2.22], [7, 2.22, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 2.68], [9, 3.08, 3.14], [10, 3.14, 3.28], [11, 3.28, 3.56], [12, 3.56, 3.76], [13, 3.76, 4.04], [14, 4.04, 4.26], [16, 4.5, 4.84], [17, 4.84, 5.18], [18, 5.18, 5.34], [19, 5.34, 5.5], [20, 5.5, 5.84]]}, {"text": "In an effort to learn new things, I put my hand towards creating an auto-buy Chrome extension to significantly increase my chances of a ticket purchase.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c27c86e6d002df7413ef95519caa6ae9afc6a20b62d1ee8fc59697a0efc6266f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.12], [6, 1.12, 1.52], [7, 1.88, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.32], [10, 2.32, 2.54], [11, 2.54, 2.74], [12, 2.74, 3.08], [13, 3.08, 3.34], [16, 4.02, 4.46], [17, 4.46, 4.7], [18, 4.7, 5.14], [19, 5.14, 5.8], [20, 5.8, 6.0], [21, 6.0, 6.32], [22, 6.32, 6.52], [23, 6.52, 6.6], [24, 6.6, 6.8], [25, 6.8, 7.2]]}, {"text": "I also intended to open source the project so anyone would be able to contribute.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/b302313caf422431f02a00df41093152eb4ab045c9e3431e03f33c116eb3b5db.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 3.02], [10, 3.02, 3.26], [11, 3.26, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.6], [13, 3.6, 3.78], [14, 3.78, 4.24]]}, {"text": "Enter rapid_fire_tickets.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/353f97699db0af7c5e7bbd9b8bdfe7477c95f93382547d51d73b27ef0b187bcd.mp3"}, {"text": "Building the Chrome Extension", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/635af85b5ed60a315b2fd940f81e1b7a193e5d49bc06d5144ed012f538e049a2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 1.26]]}, {"text": "If you get lost, feel free to download the source code for this extension at https://github.com/KevinColemanInc/rapid_fire_tickets", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e72d2329699376be90ae42bce12685215eaf9913f3312898a33b979374c13f86.mp3"}, {"text": "Chrome extensions allow you to inject javascript on the page for DOM manipulation.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/93b94cfea51a3f7dc0fec7e99037057a3bc3c84d1cde388aea99cc0544e6b2db.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.82, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.64], [5, 1.64, 2.0], [6, 2.0, 2.42], [7, 2.42, 2.88], [8, 2.88, 2.98], [9, 2.98, 3.26], [10, 3.26, 3.5], [11, 3.5, 3.7], [12, 3.7, 4.26]]}, {"text": "Firstly, you should create a directory and with our project name as the title.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c5a50a671e13f667c5c9c9a73888a261781bcef7527a7a69c54a11594ff6b42d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.48, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.46], [7, 1.8, 1.96], [8, 1.96, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.72], [12, 2.94, 3.04], [13, 3.04, 3.32]]}, {"text": "Now create a manifest.json file.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/7d898f80b043e9b850d2d9b6a842cfceb73295b10726d31fd7931281d58942df.mp3"}, {"text": "This file contains all of the high level descriptive information about your project like the name, description, what permissions it wants, what version it is, etc.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/9627e9998239a7c3d409bc62e52a6de69d885f81427f34b6d84241d1cd8f3e1c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.78], [8, 1.78, 2.16], [9, 2.16, 2.7], [10, 2.7, 3.18], [11, 3.18, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.9], [13, 4.26, 4.52], [14, 4.52, 4.68], [15, 4.68, 4.92], [16, 5.3, 5.7], [17, 6.24, 6.32], [18, 6.32, 6.72], [19, 6.72, 6.98], [20, 6.98, 7.18], [21, 7.6, 7.78], [22, 7.78, 8.12], [23, 8.12, 8.28], [24, 8.28, 8.54], [25, 8.76, 9.0]]}, {"text": "The first part is very self explanatory, but the content_scripts attribute is much more interesting.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/27673af4e2c8b369ca39d7a2315391bee5a2a0928ac29822f31ae19cf07b4fc5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.1], [1, 0.1, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.26], [6, 1.26, 1.98], [7, 2.1, 2.18], [8, 2.18, 2.3], [11, 4.22, 4.48], [12, 4.48, 4.64], [13, 4.64, 4.84], [14, 4.84, 5.28]]}, {"text": "Here you can request Chrome to run javascript files if the URL pattern matches the string provided.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/1b3ed7591fde7848edf52e1c5704de45c67a36e7f6a8600c9e874019e746ac7e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.76], [9, 2.76, 3.02], [10, 3.02, 3.16], [11, 3.16, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.8], [13, 3.8, 4.16], [14, 4.16, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.6], [16, 4.6, 5.02]]}, {"text": "Since I know that the ticketing website’s URL is such, I included that in the matches string.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f13706db203c70faf4b57fc27bcd39c845cb681ca9c1bb04121d4dc47a5a2b3d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 1.12], [6, 1.12, 1.58], [7, 1.58, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.42], [9, 2.42, 2.82], [10, 3.22, 3.3], [11, 3.3, 3.62], [12, 3.62, 3.92], [13, 3.92, 4.12], [14, 4.12, 4.2], [15, 4.2, 4.52], [16, 4.52, 4.94]]}, {"text": "The asterisk at the end of the string protects me against any strange URL parameters that might present themselves.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/92fe427afe90b4d483b7487cbd529527566b0f03a520a1a82e5add8131632b28.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.68], [8, 1.68, 2.12], [9, 2.12, 2.44], [10, 2.44, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.08], [12, 3.08, 3.48], [13, 3.48, 3.9], [14, 3.9, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 4.9], [16, 4.9, 5.04], [17, 5.04, 5.34], [18, 5.34, 5.8]]}, {"text": "The js attribute tells Chrome to run the included js files when that URL is hit.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/1f5f3822b00440903025f4be3e8db73c547d90e3b79624fedeec7ba0abd6f0b8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.66], [5, 1.66, 1.92], [6, 1.92, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.94], [10, 2.94, 3.44], [11, 3.44, 3.72], [12, 3.72, 3.86], [13, 3.86, 4.12], [14, 4.12, 4.5], [15, 4.5, 4.68]]}, {"text": "I included jQuery in this extension so make life easier.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/73526c2897315c52a5fd00d73e0b372256a733e69175cf8ba70e625f5ac1e95e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.52], [3, 1.1, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.88], [6, 2.1, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.32], [8, 2.32, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 2.86]]}, {"text": "Then I put my custom js file that will be used to refresh the page and select tickets.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d3555888127abdca1c0256c818318163d1483cc5fda817e4025a6e1cbbe3b3ad.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.4], [3, 0.4, 0.54], [4, 0.54, 0.88], [6, 1.26, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 2.3], [8, 2.3, 2.42], [9, 2.42, 2.56], [10, 2.56, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 2.96], [12, 2.96, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.48], [14, 3.48, 3.82], [15, 3.82, 4.08], [16, 4.08, 4.42]]}, {"text": "The run_at attribute requests that chrome run the JS at document start.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2c057a5d6f1078f63385d19bec49f7b952a7710018cb9ddc3ec0a1ecce81db08.mp3"}, {"text": "I did this because I wanted the JS to run before all of the attributes to load so it will behave faster.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/8231aeefcd087b2993386c4eab70040a35dbb2ee79829fc55773374a857be6f5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.88], [5, 0.88, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.34], [7, 1.34, 1.58], [8, 1.58, 1.82], [9, 1.82, 1.98], [10, 1.98, 2.3], [11, 2.3, 2.56], [12, 2.56, 2.66], [13, 2.66, 2.8], [14, 2.8, 3.14], [15, 3.14, 3.46], [16, 3.46, 3.68], [17, 4.06, 4.22], [18, 4.22, 4.34], [19, 4.34, 4.42], [20, 4.42, 4.66], [21, 4.66, 5.16]]}, {"text": "Next I will go download jQuery and save it into this folder.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/73233de59a5dc579f740b2d744cf1b3732614a57a8158f5b7c2340a9ce4b1bfc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 1.06], [6, 1.72, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.34], [9, 2.34, 2.5], [10, 2.5, 2.72], [11, 2.72, 3.04]]}, {"text": "Be sure to name the file the same as how you named it the manifest file.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/128524fbe48be073a3812a8c0536361a590123be3cd155ba759815c45bd1b44c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.88], [5, 0.88, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.44], [7, 1.44, 1.68], [8, 1.68, 1.88], [9, 1.88, 2.02], [10, 2.02, 2.18], [11, 2.18, 2.46], [12, 2.46, 2.6], [13, 2.6, 2.76], [15, 3.14, 3.64]]}, {"text": "Next I will create my home.js file.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/7f6e99e9084fff56004fe0bce3f1e1cf3b9571168bd12b42155cb997ffac379e.mp3"}, {"text": "The idea here is to have it refresh the page until the we see the drop down for ticket selection.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f0107aeccf8bc2880f6749f33ee2b946ef79eeb2991c1d434bdca77681b342ec.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.16], [6, 1.16, 1.28], [7, 1.28, 1.56], [8, 1.56, 1.84], [9, 1.84, 2.12], [10, 2.12, 2.42], [12, 2.42, 2.7], [13, 2.7, 2.9], [14, 2.9, 3.04], [15, 3.04, 3.24], [16, 3.24, 3.5], [17, 3.5, 3.72], [18, 3.72, 3.96], [19, 3.96, 4.42]]}, {"text": "Once that appears we need to set that to a value of 2 and click the submit button on the form.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/b53e3ee4f86751c62d73402ffe332800a02b6441c37384e138b02bd7970a1488.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.72], [3, 1.04, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.6], [8, 1.6, 1.74], [9, 1.74, 1.82], [10, 1.82, 2.06], [11, 2.06, 2.22], [12, 2.22, 2.46], [13, 2.46, 2.96], [14, 2.96, 3.16], [15, 3.16, 3.4], [17, 3.72, 4.08], [18, 4.08, 4.28], [19, 4.28, 4.4], [20, 4.4, 4.74]]}, {"text": "Testing", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/89c8e7e9955016a7127cb15a0c151c0ebafcfb5319856909e172a560d945c83c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44]]}, {"text": "From that link, we have no idea what the HTML looks and thus don’t know how to sculpt the jQuery selectors to target the correct form elements.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/7fe6bae5644d9db9406fe07792801854a245445985d6464c26b0f8652ab5ca88.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.74], [3, 1.06, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 2.96], [10, 2.96, 3.38], [11, 3.38, 3.82], [12, 3.82, 4.12], [13, 4.12, 4.48], [14, 4.48, 4.6], [15, 4.6, 4.76], [16, 4.76, 4.88], [18, 5.18, 5.42], [20, 5.92, 6.58], [21, 6.58, 6.96], [22, 6.96, 7.34], [23, 7.34, 7.56], [24, 7.56, 7.84], [25, 7.84, 8.26], [26, 8.26, 8.64]]}, {"text": "I created a test event and modeled it to behave exactly like the tfus event will when the tickets are released.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/08303a2129e80279384d53d2bc04df6b5395c3a650c7d204c7695568854df9e3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.38], [10, 2.38, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.22], [12, 3.22, 3.38], [14, 3.82, 4.12], [15, 4.12, 4.42], [16, 4.42, 4.74], [17, 4.74, 4.86], [18, 4.86, 5.06], [19, 5.06, 5.24], [20, 5.24, 5.56]]}, {"text": "This way I can test my software before aiming it at the first event.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d8e202e702527415d3f7b5eb89b6fd092af72e7888d885df88eff7f53fdf6049.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.12], [6, 1.12, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 2.06], [9, 2.06, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.42], [11, 2.42, 2.54], [12, 2.54, 2.72], [13, 2.72, 3.06]]}, {"text": "Refresh and check to see if tickets are available", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a3bc50693dc788c1694ff5c42a9aac182589eb15e7bc173a77fa13a22a92a626.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.52], [1, 0.52, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 2.0], [8, 2.0, 2.4]]}, {"text": "On my test page I noticed that the orange submit button appears on the page when tickets are available.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/fab94eb26816d2823236e018550c7059de4bba3cfca2808f2efa7db27550b206.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 1.06], [4, 1.42, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.36], [10, 2.72, 3.1], [11, 3.1, 3.46], [12, 3.46, 3.78], [13, 3.78, 3.9], [14, 3.9, 4.24], [15, 4.24, 4.42], [16, 4.42, 4.66], [17, 4.66, 4.9], [18, 4.9, 5.3]]}, {"text": "For this tool, I am going to look for all orange buttons on the page.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d094b98d0bca5be058d6e28aad9e0412b4fbec29278712cf0ab1a7bd2c0db325.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.8], [3, 1.26, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.46], [5, 1.46, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.24], [9, 2.24, 2.5], [10, 2.5, 2.84], [11, 2.84, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.38], [13, 3.38, 3.5], [14, 3.5, 3.92]]}, {"text": "If one appears, then tickets are ready to be purchased.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a9a9b30b34c7afcace7092825443c315a51e0eeefd9827aedb69dce14f7ebba2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.72], [3, 1.16, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.54]]}, {"text": "If they are not, then we need to reload the page to check again.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e2217dac10ebeac3ef46370b3926b685d964ae9ed467046f6c9fb8cd6db38aff.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.66], [4, 1.1, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.48], [7, 1.48, 1.62], [8, 1.62, 1.92], [9, 1.92, 2.12], [10, 2.12, 2.36], [11, 2.36, 2.56], [12, 2.56, 2.7], [13, 2.7, 3.02]]}, {"text": "Select the number of tickets you want", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e0b2a696b803667dbc0af180196b7a4bb245e0d4af38310a31fb388cbc39ade9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.8]]}, {"text": "Now that I can detect when the tickets are available.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/b810e20dc212028b18595ee288cdbda536f7deede3b58c992b81e205466edac3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.32], [7, 1.32, 1.52], [8, 1.52, 1.74], [9, 1.74, 2.18]]}, {"text": "I am need to select the drop down and select the number of tickets.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/83b4b657d0612a9d9f60155721e61ce0fe4625a247cce4f67c1d623a05aeaa23.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.24], [3, 0.4, 0.58], [4, 0.58, 0.86], [5, 0.86, 1.04], [6, 1.04, 1.22], [7, 1.22, 1.48], [8, 1.48, 1.84], [9, 1.84, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.4], [11, 2.4, 2.6], [12, 2.6, 2.76], [13, 2.76, 2.98]]}, {"text": "Using Chrome development tools, I found that this selector worked nicely at accomplishing that.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/02e5c94f10c3d163955c82d6109f68a20c496fab80977dfe4590ab865e738b74.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.18], [4, 1.38, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 1.96], [8, 1.96, 2.38], [10, 2.6, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.18], [12, 3.18, 3.7], [13, 3.7, 3.94]]}, {"text": "The id of the first element changes event to event, so if I wish to use this against other events, this will need to change.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/0c429e320515c93089111bfaca7a45eb68b3ae098d5322c35eb11d2defcf67a1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [2, 0.46, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.42], [9, 2.42, 2.78], [10, 3.4, 3.78], [11, 3.78, 3.94], [12, 3.94, 4.02], [13, 4.02, 4.2], [14, 4.2, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.58], [16, 4.58, 4.8], [17, 4.8, 5.2], [18, 5.2, 5.62], [19, 5.62, 6.06], [20, 6.52, 6.66], [21, 6.66, 6.8], [22, 6.8, 6.98], [23, 6.98, 7.14], [24, 7.14, 7.6]]}, {"text": "Putting it all together we get this:", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4373c11d2423e3df9358693c801dacc3cecf495462e460c71fb82a8a63cd1e05.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 1.16], [4, 1.42, 1.62], [5, 1.62, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.02]]}, {"text": "```javascript home.js $(document).ready(function () { if ($(“.bpt_orangebutton”).length != 0) { $( “#bpt_date_prices_1017125 .bpt_widget_price_table tr:nth-child(4) select” ).val(2); $(“.bpt_orangebutton”).click(); } else { location.reload(); } });", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/eac9bc0bf37237338d87e4d520793a30213530b2e2811cd3ce83340d8b6a3c00.mp3"}, {"text": "Rather than locating that button and click it.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/20cc633085a8e5691e7e5028b5e8ac4c08f163979bb8c203d0e62f1df9e654bd.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.26, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.92], [6, 1.92, 2.18], [7, 2.18, 2.38]]}, {"text": "I recognized that button is just a link to the checkout page so I ask the browser to relocate to this page.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f5abbf4985060fb4d79a8ac9dd03449a57da691928423749545687ee15ac5583.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [2, 0.58, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.32], [10, 2.32, 2.6], [11, 2.6, 3.14], [12, 3.32, 3.48], [13, 3.48, 3.6], [14, 3.6, 3.8], [15, 3.8, 3.96], [16, 3.96, 4.2], [17, 4.2, 4.48], [18, 4.48, 5.06], [19, 5.06, 5.22], [20, 5.22, 5.38], [21, 5.38, 5.78]]}, {"text": "If there are an cosmetic changes to this page and they change how the page is displayed, it may break any selectors I use on finding that button.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d551801593c53db787b8d3efe9a0897f9d9f83f49fef1adfe336f43199c830f7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.52], [4, 0.68, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.9], [7, 1.9, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.56], [10, 2.9, 3.02], [11, 3.02, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.5], [13, 3.5, 3.62], [14, 3.62, 3.88], [15, 3.88, 4.04], [16, 4.04, 4.48], [17, 4.92, 5.02], [18, 5.02, 5.14], [19, 5.14, 5.38], [20, 5.38, 5.64], [21, 5.64, 6.26], [22, 6.26, 6.38], [23, 6.38, 6.62], [24, 6.62, 6.82], [25, 6.82, 7.14], [26, 7.14, 7.36], [27, 7.36, 7.66]]}, {"text": "This solution is much more elegant and simple.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e8a1d0c6ebba9ccee16fa6250497fa3acd194b7633a6861548cc700531400ee3.mp3"}, {"text": "Installation", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/34d420ef4dd46946cb41772d7a6475db3d4206faef8ff288938a76edd28ea686.mp3"}, {"text": "In Chrome to chrome://extensions/ and click “Load unpacked extensions”", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/061feaa9f339cae80a86667148d0f21f7aa79f776cb8e8e21a04f1f086e356b8.mp3"}, {"text": "Navigate to the location of the folder you created with the manifest.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/5c510b5d582a7b4690d718b170f655b43858e1715610174f96471845696a0636.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.38], [10, 2.38, 2.46], [11, 2.46, 2.8]]}, {"text": "Sign into your http://www.brownpapertickets.com account", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ae21d00c14324e8eeeb41a911a8f73bf9eb8c1748fc91396b0e681d64b7e5f27.mp3"}, {"text": "Open a bunch of tabs in chrome and navigate them all to: http://www.brownpapertickets.com/event/614931", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6a85ecce2903453c65445dcde4de4f226f2d4daec9ce97bf694bd76ff04876ac.mp3"}, {"text": "Alternative installation (using my source code on github).", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e1e716f1128676edda22bf96cdd702fe87a37705bc985f6012f5d9d919762c9c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.62, 1.16], [2, 1.16, 1.82], [3, 1.82, 2.04], [4, 2.04, 2.28], [5, 2.28, 2.52], [6, 2.52, 2.72], [7, 2.72, 2.9]]}, {"text": "Download the zip file", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/849b659c1327cb2d7d38e5c7427adb29fd08bf1770bfacbe884f3f52b0b64d3f.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.3, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 1.04]]}, {"text": "Unzip it", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/572a095ffc8211182144032d36c8c0b59caefe5605ebd03fe2bb36191742c180.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.74]]}, {"text": "In Chrome to chrome://extensions/ and click “Load unpacked extensions”", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/061feaa9f339cae80a86667148d0f21f7aa79f776cb8e8e21a04f1f086e356b8.mp3"}, {"text": "Navigate to the unziped location of the file.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/fa6106bf825ee52dd24551fa37c4832ac3fd9439ab41e79cdebd6ab6c1f3eee8.mp3"}, {"text": "Sign into your http://www.brownpapertickets.com account", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ae21d00c14324e8eeeb41a911a8f73bf9eb8c1748fc91396b0e681d64b7e5f27.mp3"}, {"text": "Open a bunch of tabs in chrome and navigate them all to: http://www.brownpapertickets.com/event/614931", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6a85ecce2903453c65445dcde4de4f226f2d4daec9ce97bf694bd76ff04876ac.mp3"}, {"text": "Buying more than two tickets", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/dbe4e6fd85fa83c14b7a427b002ee4329a07eaf321bd809e81678518ca30089f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.1]]}, {"text": "This extension will only purchase two tickets per installation of Chrome.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4cbb6679ab480c37dfaccdf6ca2aaddb1a0926f1e32cc3b3812d3be62c481c66.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.2], [5, 1.5, 1.84], [6, 1.84, 2.18], [7, 2.18, 2.42], [8, 2.42, 2.92], [9, 2.92, 3.16], [10, 3.16, 3.4]]}, {"text": "If you are interested in using this to accumulate more, then here are my recommendations.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/819e011e065818f6a8ff4847e908c1d432eebb7022ba4ffb1878af66dc7401d9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.56], [10, 3.08, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.54], [13, 3.54, 3.64], [14, 3.64, 4.2]]}, {"text": "In chrome://extensions/, scroll down to the rapid_fire_tickets and select “Allow in incognito mode.”", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/7841f29286cb49e6ec92c33b9f3886914e2cd76ec9a6bcc1686794b921271e61.mp3"}, {"text": "Incognito mode allows you to login to Brown Paper Tickets from another account (thus giving you an additional 2 more tickets).", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/74ea33fe13837b4caae772e8335fdc67b9b1fac86fd8d8662e4b08a7ed81d3f2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [2, 0.8, 1.08], [3, 1.08, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.42], [7, 1.92, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.48], [9, 2.48, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 3.06], [11, 3.06, 3.4], [12, 3.4, 3.96], [13, 4.4, 4.54], [14, 4.54, 4.82], [15, 4.82, 5.0], [16, 5.0, 5.1], [17, 5.1, 5.52], [19, 5.86, 6.14], [20, 6.14, 6.48]]}, {"text": "Now press Ctrl+Shift+N to open a new incognito window, login to a different account and navigate to the event page.", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/9002c7b8258aa952983e348e691db21d91d0f58fa16bc36bb5f8f45a43fa32d8.mp3"}, {"text": "Now you buy 4 tickets!", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/aa136aca318eae55dbc3456e275ab9b8060e0e039a70a3ef5ac2c3f99e183e7c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.34]]}, {"text": "Next, we should install a couple copies of Chrome.", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/7babf861b0a9ae7d33ad3709ae019b34861d9cb0b37afacf2e2c85b39270f6aa.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.62, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.22]]}, {"text": "Chrome only allows one version to be installed on a computer at a given time.", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2b21afd93ba5d363004d135a69a08829a0174af4ac939ae4cac31373576e7b0d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.58], [5, 1.58, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.48], [10, 2.48, 2.84], [11, 2.84, 3.06], [12, 3.06, 3.12], [13, 3.12, 3.34], [14, 3.34, 3.68]]}, {"text": "So lets grab other builds!", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/fd598f87919df65408975f025f0cd0170a91c34fb7bff26825999caae1323039.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.56]]}, {"text": "Go to http://www.chromium.org/getting-involved/dev-channel and download and install their canary release.", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/996d3b28b22e0ef5178bad90cdd97fc0b4c12170805bb9d19f087f760bd4fdb8.mp3"}, {"text": "This version runs seperately from what you have on your computer, because it can be less stable.", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c7ada56ed5a7595cde75cd4c1628378b00da153d7cc3ac49222ff974bc2d86c2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.7], [4, 1.12, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.2], [10, 2.2, 2.62], [12, 3.18, 3.34], [13, 3.34, 3.44], [14, 3.44, 3.54], [15, 3.54, 3.76], [16, 3.76, 4.18]]}, {"text": "Configure the extension like you did before and now you have 8 tickets you can purchase!", "block": 39, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/3242db145c33ae81bc17309bfba31e5f99e462b2c1693ed201f81325a7fe2302.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.46, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.64], [10, 2.64, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.32], [13, 3.32, 3.54], [14, 3.54, 3.66], [15, 3.66, 3.98]]}, {"text": "Remember, only two tickets can be purchased at once per account so be sure to use different accounts.", "block": 39, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/bde4f9d602a177d6672ec36aaba1ee4f2227d044f3be9950dcb30b708751134f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.78, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.34], [8, 2.34, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 3.04], [11, 3.2, 3.26], [12, 3.26, 3.38], [13, 3.38, 3.58], [14, 3.58, 3.76], [15, 3.76, 3.92], [16, 3.92, 4.18], [17, 4.18, 4.5]]}, {"text": "Quick tip: One gmail for multiple accounts", "block": 40, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4a4cba059add9de6b657439b3dfd2f9e7459bcf0096dd892e34b78df0d1c7ab5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [3, 1.08, 1.38], [4, 1.38, 1.62], [5, 1.62, 1.9], [6, 1.9, 2.36]]}, {"text": "If you use gmail, you can use their wild card feature to have different emails that point to your email.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d7fd8dedabeb4e969c71cc4bff7a9e37bf608f770195025d8993bdd6e7b888ea.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.9], [4, 1.22, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.26], [9, 2.26, 2.5], [10, 2.5, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.14], [12, 3.14, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.52], [14, 3.52, 3.88], [15, 3.88, 4.18], [16, 4.18, 4.38], [17, 4.38, 4.6], [18, 4.6, 4.7], [19, 4.7, 5.0]]}, {"text": "For example my email is c.programer@gmail.com.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/68d4d09e21848745318641ca39569cf1d897bcf6224167fb1b6229af038ae68e.mp3"}, {"text": "I can create a different brown paper tickets account with this email c.programer+bpt@gmail.com and all of the emails going to that new email go to my main inbox.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/b2eab3e5bf37246376c884c8ce000039a205a81c0b4bc7c7d06544b303ed6658.mp3"}, {"text": "This way I don’t have to keep creating emails to make new accounts.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/46b30121c05b15e58cdbdaed5211316a8b6b93db07618127a6f4742422b2d810.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.54], [2, 0.72, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.34], [7, 1.34, 1.72], [8, 1.72, 2.12], [9, 2.12, 2.42], [10, 2.42, 2.6], [11, 2.6, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.12]]}, {"text": "Anything between the + and the @ symbols are ignored in gmail only.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/1942afaee4f077833228f6596b26898592e5d54fdc1cc69005583ff2a2935666.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.38, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 0.9], [4, 1.12, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.44], [7, 1.44, 1.74], [8, 1.74, 1.94], [9, 1.94, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.4], [11, 2.4, 2.66], [12, 2.66, 3.04]]}, {"text": "Lets scale this further (8 to infinite and beyond!)", "block": 42, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/dbfb3844bf1b106ca3c0fd503f031e691e971172e1f1ec465e34539dfa361310.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.16], [4, 1.46, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.06], [7, 2.06, 2.3], [8, 2.3, 2.64]]}, {"text": "We can apply this technique to multiple computers.", "block": 43, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/de89ad67f7dce5a8b6b1283049bbfa46f4803a033fb8cbc8ea12c5458ac3315f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 2.16]]}, {"text": "Each computer earns you 8 tickets.", "block": 43, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/0ada017f4a49218780960fd260e6f6887e766e2bc003933856d9709dd39c5344.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.9]]}, {"text": "So if you are like myself that has a laptop and a desktop and a gf’s computer, then I would have the opportunity to purchase 24 tickets!", "block": 43, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a7d3d9131d4be29d0014c68a79241155a975a849898459c4ae5f9450bcf964f4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.42, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.66], [4, 0.74, 0.88], [5, 0.88, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.54], [7, 1.54, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.78], [9, 1.78, 2.06], [11, 2.44, 2.54], [12, 2.54, 2.84], [13, 4.12, 4.34], [14, 4.34, 4.44], [17, 5.62, 5.72], [18, 5.72, 5.88], [19, 5.88, 6.06], [20, 6.06, 6.18], [21, 6.18, 6.36], [22, 6.36, 6.82], [23, 6.82, 7.08], [24, 7.08, 7.34], [25, 7.34, 7.9], [26, 7.9, 8.28]]}, {"text": "This scales at 8 tickets per computer.", "block": 43, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/706ae043d31ced8c42b5eb82499131e72d3e39b1907882d18f8ce31dee7801a7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.52], [6, 1.52, 1.98]]}, {"text": "So 10 computers allows you to purchase 80 tickets (or 8% of all tickets avaliable!).", "block": 43, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e61c20033c8994c05ba28ba9406ba5766704009be3f3eaf2b06b40b7540f04b4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.28], [8, 2.28, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 3.22], [10, 3.22, 3.46], [11, 3.78, 4.0], [12, 4.0, 4.2], [13, 4.2, 4.5]]}, {"text": "For those with more resources, you can go to a public library or a college’s computer lab to install an apply this extension to an even larger number of computers.", "block": 44, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d353c0b816fc0b67db2fed8f99cab5f423950a1b1939fd6c51b49e529ee24568.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.46], [5, 2.0, 2.06], [6, 2.06, 2.22], [7, 2.22, 2.42], [8, 2.42, 2.62], [9, 2.62, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.52], [12, 3.52, 3.88], [14, 3.88, 4.5], [15, 4.5, 4.8], [16, 4.8, 5.08], [17, 5.08, 5.32], [18, 5.32, 5.7], [20, 5.92, 6.2], [21, 6.2, 6.44], [22, 6.44, 6.88], [23, 6.88, 7.2], [24, 7.2, 7.3], [25, 7.3, 7.58], [26, 7.58, 7.92], [27, 7.92, 8.26], [28, 8.26, 8.46], [29, 8.46, 8.82]]}, {"text": "Conclusion", "block": 45, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/4888e403da94f4096ce831f4178717ca07d3749347a8d426ba8b09313a16232c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.64]]}, {"text": "Feel free to hack and fork this tool as much as you would like.", "block": 46, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a83d22f8004820d10e651125425106b0f38d65c0b40b9f0010f918d2bdb67e2d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.98], [9, 1.98, 2.18], [10, 2.18, 2.36], [11, 2.36, 2.46], [12, 2.46, 2.6], [13, 2.6, 2.9]]}, {"text": "I really hope that everyone enjoyed reading this as much I as I enjoyed writing it.", "block": 46, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/73afd10809c3a4423e39dae52f87a8068a88ffbbfafd30f1baac72aa0b4b0cf9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.1], [1, 0.1, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.3], [6, 1.3, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.18], [9, 2.18, 2.4], [11, 2.72, 3.26], [12, 3.26, 3.38], [13, 3.38, 3.6], [14, 3.6, 3.92], [15, 3.92, 4.2]]}, {"text": "Best of luck to everyone buying tickets this weekend!", "block": 46, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c155f098ccde5ad177dc374cf2ad77c9d33a6035ad40b4985e55a9e06afa8a4d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.54], [7, 1.54, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.08]]}, {"text": "Notes", "block": 47, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/9b80a6e5274c3f96f8fa2ee524e6a66d3c2e2023dca4cf56ed472d9f59f0e0c2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3]]}, {"text": "I would be careful about opening too many tabs, because they may actually slow down the process.", "block": 48, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c650bd965040b89c3821f4d1dafe3381140868659d3b15e4c1495c71ca05ba57.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.36], [3, 0.36, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.58], [7, 1.58, 1.78], [8, 1.78, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.5], [10, 2.5, 2.72], [11, 2.72, 2.86], [12, 2.86, 3.22], [13, 3.22, 3.52], [14, 3.52, 3.68], [15, 3.68, 3.84], [16, 3.84, 4.18]]}, {"text": "In experimentation, I was able to grab 2 tickets to an event I created with 12 tabs within 10 seconds of the release.", "block": 48, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d08441bba6364407f1524b4b4f93e910b24943da5d4517e93137a557b5de8cd7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.72], [2, 1.26, 1.28], [3, 1.28, 1.42], [4, 1.42, 1.62], [5, 1.62, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 1.98], [8, 2.28, 2.62], [9, 2.62, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 2.98], [11, 2.98, 3.18], [12, 3.18, 3.4], [13, 3.4, 3.76], [14, 3.76, 4.0], [15, 4.0, 4.28], [16, 4.28, 4.7], [17, 4.7, 5.1], [18, 5.1, 5.44], [19, 5.44, 5.76], [20, 5.76, 5.98], [21, 5.98, 6.1], [22, 6.1, 6.36]]}, {"text": "This currently attempts to grab the maximum amount of tickets (2).", "block": 49, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f7a8765edc1dfae62bfea11459e4e6a172a1ce71d95b58e5b24a59e4dab47b50.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.26], [8, 2.26, 2.46], [9, 2.46, 2.7]]}, {"text": "PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE check back with the project an hour before tickets become avaliable.", "block": 50, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/aac30b45fe65600d10b85d9467da054830dd8d28249233c0126199ffb090482b.mp3"}, {"text": "I plan on releasing an updated version of the project to handle any issues that may arise.", "block": 50, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/cd3361add9991375c4f4441df97881d594020766de5b0e274bb6494713b3cabd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.36], [10, 2.36, 2.54], [11, 2.54, 2.8], [12, 2.8, 3.1], [13, 3.1, 3.42], [14, 3.42, 3.64], [15, 3.64, 3.78], [16, 3.78, 4.08]]}]}